  },
  "solutionPortBlockedFixed": "If you're currently connected to a managed network (work, school, public Wi-Fi), port {port} is blocked by policy — try mobile data or a VPN instead. On your own network, check the firewall rules in your router settings.",
  "@solutionPortBlockedFixed": {
